    Format (ext\p60_snap.py): "addr hexdword float" lines, NONZERO dwords only,
    of +-1 page around each of 236 name-hit pages (entity-cluster PAs such as
    0x73ccd8000 / the 0x4d0xxxxxx cluster). Zero dwords are omitted, so a page
    reconstructs with zeros filled where no line exists.
